rce":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112507395046861","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1298","post_id":"1298","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112459455098901","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-10-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1298/","text":"Between Covid and insufficient public funding for elections, there are unprecedented challenges for election officials working to make sure everyone can vote safely this year. Last month Priscilla...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112459455098901","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1297","post_id":"1297","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112462349962571","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-10-13","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1297/","text":"Facebook's Oculus Quest 2 starts shipping today! It's another big step forward for VR. I've been using mine all summer and I'm looking forward to more of you experiencing this.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112462349962571","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1299","post_id":"1299","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112455086578451","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-10-12","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1299/","text":"Today we're updating our hate speech policy to ban Holocaust denial.\n\nWe've long taken down posts that praise hate crimes or mass murder, including the Holocaust. But with rising anti-Semitism, we're...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112455086578451","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1300","post_id":"1300","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112425273613871","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-10-06","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1300/","text":"Happy 10th birthday to Instagram! And thank you to everyone who has made Instagram so special. I can't believe that it's been eight years since Instagram joined us - the community and the service...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112425273613871","text_truncated":false}]